7375, PubMed:29599178). Has low flippase activity toward glucosylceramide (GlcCer) (PubMed:30530492)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}